[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":54},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28},"tipo","etapa","cubo",{"_11":52,"_13":52,"_38":53},"id","basico-primeira-camada","nome","1st layer","rascunho",false,"html","<p>Now come the 4 white corners. Each one goes on the bottom, between the <a href=\"/en/glossary#cruz\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The 4 edges of one face (usually white) in place, lined up with the centers. The first step of the beginner method and of CFOP.\">cross</a>, and completes the white face. A single algorithm solves every case: the <a href=\"/en/glossary#sexy-move\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The trigger R U R' U', the most common of all.\">sexy move</a>, <code>R U R&#39; U&#39;</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/6dc8d9df99c7516e.svg\" alt=\"The goal: the white face done and the first row of each side matching its center.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The goal: the white face done and the first row of each side matching its center.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;z2&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/93635bba36862feb.svg\" alt=\"The same cube, turned upside down (`z2`): the white face in view.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The same cube, turned upside down (<code>z2</code>): the white face in view.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Take the corner above its place</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Look on top for a corner with white.</li>\n<li>See its other two colors. Its place is on the bottom, between the centers of those colors.</li>\n<li>Turn the top (<code>U</code>) until the corner is exactly above that place.</li>\n<li>Turn the whole cube so the corner is at the <strong>front right</strong>, on top.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U' R' U&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;U'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><ol aria-label=\"U'\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/524abbc91b37544f-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/524abbc91b37544f-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>The white, green and orange corner is above green and red. Its place is between green and orange: <code>U&#39;</code> takes the corner above that place.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Do the sexy move until the corner goes in</h2>\n<p>Repeat <code>R U R&#39; U&#39;</code> until the corner goes down into place, with white facing down. How many times depends on where the white is facing:</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/8e000ca91c3bbd3e.svg\" alt=\"White facing right: 1 sexy move.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>White facing right: 1 sexy move.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U' R' U R U2 R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R U R' U' R U R' U'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/42483da247f6c0d1.svg\" alt=\"White facing up: 3 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>White facing up: 3 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;F' U F&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R U R' U' R U R' U' R U R' U' R U R' U'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/a27262ac50d273a7.svg\" alt=\"White facing the front: 5 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>White facing the front: 5 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><ol aria-label=\"R U R' U'\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/03737516f0cc8507-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/03737516f0cc8507-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/03737516f0cc8507-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/03737516f0cc8507-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/03737516f0cc8507-4.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>White facing right, one sexy move and done.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>Click a diagram to see the sexy moves on the 3D cube. You don&#39;t need to count: do the sexy move and look. When the corner goes in right, stop. The cross doesn&#39;t come apart, because the sexy move always puts the bottom pieces back.</p>\n<h2>Corner on the bottom, in the wrong place</h2>\n<p>If the corner is already on the bottom, but in the wrong place or twisted, take it out: hold the cube with it at the front right, on the bottom, and do one sexy move. It comes up, and you continue as above.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R U R' U'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R U R' U' R U R' U' R U R' U'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/69053b0389ac55b6.svg\" alt=\"Corner in place, but twisted (white facing the front): the 1st sexy move takes it out, and 3 more put it back, right.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Corner in place, but twisted (white facing the front): the 1st sexy move takes it out, and 3 more put it back, right.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Shortcuts</h2>\n<p>The cards of this step show shorter algorithms for each case (<code>R U R&#39;</code> with white facing right, for example). They do the same as the sexy move. Use them once the sexy move comes without thinking.</p>\n","treino","/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/primeira-camada/casos","metodos",[47],"anterior",{"_13":45,"_38":46},"proximo",{"_13":43,"_38":44},"grupos",[29],{"_11":30,"_13":14,"_31":32,"_33":34,"_35":16,"_36":37,"_38":39},"Passo 2","nivel","iniciante","casos",3,"conjunto","ids",[40,41,42],"endereco","/3x3/basico/primeira-camada/casos","B2-Branco-a-direita","B2-Branco-na-frente","B2-Branco-em-cima","2nd layer","/3x3/basico/segunda-camada","White cross","/3x3/basico/cruz",{"_13":48,"_49":50,"_38":51},"Beginner method","numero",4,"/3x3/basico#primeira-camada","3x3","/3x3/",{"_55":56,"_57":58},"cubos",[61,62,63,64,65,66],"idiomas",[59,60],"pt","en",{"_11":52,"_13":52},{"_11":73,"_13":73},{"_11":72,"_13":72},{"_11":71,"_13":71},{"_11":69,"_13":70},{"_11":67,"_13":68},"pyraminx","Pyraminx","megaminx","Megaminx","5x5","4x4","2x2"]
